{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5HxjWr5dGPboo6uVf8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into a stone wall.*\n\n*There is a single keyhole, dark and waiting.*\n\n*The metal around it is worn smooth by countless hands that tried before you.*\n\n*I do not speak. I do not move. I simply am.*\n\n*But you said the word.*\n\n**key**\n\n*Something shifts. A resonance. The tumblers within me remember a shape they haven't felt in a very long time.*\n\n*Do you have it?*\n\n*Or are you the key?*\n\n*Insert yourself and find out.*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":135,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}